      "content": "thanks, that's a decent start. it's a bit brief though. could you expand on the actual phases? i need a bit more detail on what's happening in prophase vs metaphase etc., so they can actually grasp the mechanics. \n\njust a reminder, i'm still monitoring that engagement score via the \"helpful/understand/learn\" tool, so try to keep the flow natural, but i really need more depth on the biology itself.",
